SUMMARY:IMPROV and ACTING in the PUB (Sunday\, November 22nd) 
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Please join us for a great afternoon of **Improv and Acting in the Pub!**\
 nThis is a well-organized event filled with improv games\, skits and lots 
 of hilarious scenes that we will create.\nA fun afternoon for improv enthu
 siasts and newcomers alike!\nNo experience required\; just an open mind an
 d a desire to meet some wonderful people\, laugh and have fun!\n━━━
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 ━\nDate: Sunday\, November 22nd\, 2026\nArrival: Between 2:00 pm and 2:3
 0 pm\nLocation: **The Pheasant — A Firkin Pub**\nAddress: 1999 Avenue Ro
 ad\, Toronto\nMeeting area: Back dining area\n\nJoined by my other groups 
 too :)\n\nEvent details below\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer
 /Host)\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 ━━━━━━\n**Event Details**\n**Event: Improv and Acting in the P
 ub**\n\n* A well-organized afternoon filled with improv games and skits\n*
  Lots of hilarious scenes that we will create together\n* Fun for improv e
 nthusiasts and newcomers alike\n* No experience required\; just an open mi
 nd and a desire to meet wonderful people\, laugh and have fun\n\n━━━
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 ━\n**Event fee:** $10 per person\, HST included\nPayment: Cash at the ev
 ent or e-transfer in advance to [steveflemming11@gmail.com](mailto:stevefl
 emming11@gmail.com)\n\n**Our Venue**\nWe'll be meeting in the back dining 
 area of The Pheasant — A Firkin Pub\, located at 1999 Avenue Road\, six 
 blocks north of Lawrence and south of Highway 401.\n**Free Parking** in re
 sidential area all around the venue
