SUMMARY:Music Bingo with Friends! (Best of 7 Decades!)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 I'd like to invite you out to a fun-filled afternoon with this fantastic s
 ocial game called **Music Bingo with Friends! (Best of 7 Decades!)**\n\nWo
 nderful music and a super fun game!\n\n\\*Joined by my other social groups
  too\; so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out\n\n\\*Please note we are a
 t **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Avenue Road (roughly 6 blocks nor
 th of Lawrence - south of the 401 **(we are in the back dining area to fin
 d us)**\n\n*\\*You can also ask the wait staff or bartender if you like to
  show you to the group (simply ask for Steve's games event)*\n\nEvent Deta
 ils Below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\n\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Details of Event:**\n**Music Bingo with Friends! (Best of
  7 Decades!)**\n\nMusic Bingo puts a fun musical twist on traditional bing
 o. Instead of listening for numbers\, you'll hear familiar songs from acro
 ss the decades and mark them off on your Music Bingo card.\n\nYou don't ne
 ed to be a music expert — recognizing the songs\, singing along and enjo
 ying the company is all part of the fun!\n\n• **Seven decades of great m
 usic** with plenty of familiar favourites\n• **Treats for our winning pa
 rticipants** during the different rounds\n• **Meet and mingle** with a f
 riendly group while enjoying a relaxed social atmosphere\n• **Come on yo
 ur own or invite some friends** — we'll get everyone settled in and read
 y to play\n\n**Event Fee: $10**\nYour event fee includes **Music Bingo\, t
 reats for our winners\, reserved seating and plenty of music\, laughs and 
 fun throughout the event.**\nPayment can be made **in cash at the event** 
 or **in advance by e-transfer to [SteveFlemming11@gmail.com](mailto:SteveF
 lemming11@gmail.com)**.\nIf paying by e-transfer\, please include **your n
 ame** in the message so your payment can be easily identified.\n\nBring yo
 ur music memories\, your sense of humour and maybe even your singing voice
  — although singing along is completely optional!\n\n**Friendly Reminder
 s:**\n\nPlease arrive between **4:30 pm and 5:00 pm (if you can)** so you'
 ll have time to get settled\, meet some people and get ready to play. **Mu
 sic Bingo will begin shortly afterward.**\n\n\\*Great dinner menu and food
  specials provided:\n(One beverage or appetizer minimum upon arrival to su
 pport venue)\n\n**Parking and Transportation:**\n\\*Lots of street parking
  on avenue and free residential parking\n[https://www.firkinpubs.com/theph
 easantandfirkin/](https://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/)\n(15-2
 0 minute walk from Yonge & Lawrence subway station-or simply take bus or u
 ber from the station)
