SUMMARY:The Casual Friday Night Cocktails and Conversations! 
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n
 ㅤ\n**Kick off the weekend with a relaxed Friday night of cocktails\, con
 versation and good company!**\nㅤ\nJoin us at **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pu
 b** in Toronto for a fun and easygoing evening where the focus is simply o
 n meeting people and enjoying ourselves.\nㅤ\nWhether you arrive on your 
 own or bring a friend\, come grab a drink\, join the conversation and spen
 d the evening getting to know some new faces.\nㅤ\n*Joined by my other so
 cial groups too\, so we can certainly anticipate a fabulous\, fun turnout!
 *\nㅤ\n*The Pheasant offers a great dinner menu\, and we'll have a reserv
 ed area for our group\, so bring your appetite if you like! :)*\nㅤ\nSinc
 erely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\nmeetup.com/soulcity/\nㅤ\n\n
 ***\n\n### Event Details:\n\n**The Casual Friday Night Cocktails and Conve
 rsations!**\nㅤ\n• Meet and mingle with a friendly group in a casual at
 mosphere.\n• Enjoy cocktails and conversation without the pressure of a 
 formal event.\n• Make new connections while starting your weekend with s
 ome laughs and good company.\n• Have some fun with friendly icebreaker g
 ames to help everyone get acquainted!\nㅤ\nCome as you are\, settle in an
 d see where the conversation takes you. Sometimes the best Friday nights a
 re the ones that aren't complicated!\nㅤ\n**Where to Find Us?**\nㅤ\nWe'
 ll be gathering in the **back dining area** at **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pu
 b**\, located at **1999 Avenue Road**\, approximately six blocks north of 
 Lawrence Avenue and south of Highway 401.\nㅤ\nIf you're unsure where to 
 go\, simply ask the bartender or wait staff for **Steve's event**. They'll
  be happy to direct you.\nㅤ\n**Event Fee:**\nㅤ\n$10 per person (HST in
 cluded) (Includes next event too)\nㅤ\nPayment can be made in cash at the
  event or\, for your convenience\, in advance by e-transfer to:\n[stevefle
 mming11@gmail.com](mailto:steveflemming11@gmail.com)\nㅤ\nIf paying by e-
 transfer\, please include your name in the message so your payment can be 
 easily identified. Thank you!\nㅤ\n**Arrival Time:**\nㅤ\nPlease arrive 
 between **6:30 p.m. and 7:30 p.m.**\, if possible.\nㅤ\n**Friendly Remind
 ers:**\nㅤ\n\n* The Pheasant offers a great dinner menu\, along with food
  and drink specials.\n* A minimum purchase of one beverage or appetizer pe
 r person is requested to help support the venue.\n* You'll find a cozy\, r
 elaxed and welcoming atmosphere\, perfect for meeting new people!\n\nㅤ\n
 **Parking and Transportation:**\nㅤ\nThere's street parking along Avenue 
 Road\, as well as free parking on nearby residential side streets where pe
 rmitted.\nㅤ\nThe venue is approximately a 15–20-minute walk from Yonge
  and Lawrence subway station. Alternatively\, you can take a bus or Uber f
 rom the station.\nㅤ\nLooking forward to seeing everyone for a fun Friday
  night of cocktails\, conversation and great company!\nReplace the bare Me
 etup linkRemove duplicated event details
