SUMMARY:Friday Night FAMILY FEUD - The After Dark- Naughty and Funny Editi
 on!
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Get ready for **Friday Night Family Feud – The After Dark Naughty and Fu
 nny Edition!** An entertaining evening of cheeky survey questions\, outrag
 eous answers\, friendly competition and plenty of laughter!\n\nWe're putti
 ng a mischievous adult twist on one of our favourite social games\, with q
 uestions about dating disasters\, romantic encounters\, flirting and hilar
 ious bedroom mishaps. You never know what the next question might reveal!\
 n\n*Super easy to learn\, play and enjoy — no experience required!*\n*Jo
 ined by my other social groups too\, so we can anticipate a fabulous turno
 ut with lots of friendly people to meet and enjoy the evening with!*\n\n**
 Event Details Below:**\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\
 nmeetup.com/soulcity/\n\n***\n\n**Details of Event:**\n\n**Friday Night Fa
 mily Feud – The After Dark Naughty and Funny Edition!**\n\nWe'll divide 
 everyone into friendly teams of 4–6 players\, competing against other gr
 oups to guess the most popular answers to a variety of funny\, suggestive 
 and occasionally risqué questions.\n\n**What Can You Expect?**\n• Hilar
 ious adult-themed survey questions covering dating\, romance\, flirting\, 
 relationships and embarrassing situations.\n• Plenty of cheeky answers\,
  unexpected surprises and laugh-out-loud moments!\n• Friendly group-vers
 us-group competition\, with multiple rounds throughout the evening.\n• C
 hocolates awarded to the winning teams after each round!\n• A relaxed\, 
 welcoming atmosphere where everyone can participate\, share a laugh and me
 et new people.\n\n**Event Fee:**\n**$10 per person (HST included)**\nCash 
 at the event\, please.\nOr pay in advance by e-transfer to:\n**[steveflemm
 ing11@gmail.com](mailto:steveflemming11@gmail.com)**\nPlease include your 
 name with your e-transfer so your payment can be easily identified.\n\n***
 \n\n**Date\, Time and Location:**\n**Date:** Friday\, November 27th\, 2026
 \n**Arrival Time:** Please arrive between 7:30 p.m. and 8:30 p.m.\, if pos
 sible.\n**Location:** The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub\n1999 Avenue Road\, Toron
 to\n(Approximately six blocks north of Lawrence Avenue and just south of H
 ighway 401)\n\n**Where to Find Us:**\nWe'll be gathering in the **back din
 ing area** of The Pheasant.\nSimply ask the bartender or wait staff for **
 Steve's event**\, and they'll direct you to our group.\n\n**Food and Drink
 s:**\nThe Pheasant offers a great dinner menu\, along with food and drink 
 specials.\n*A minimum purchase of one beverage or appetizer upon arrival i
 s requested to help support the venue.*\n\n***\n\n**Parking and Transporta
 tion:**\n• Street parking is available along Avenue Road\, with free par
 king on nearby residential side streets where permitted.\n• Approximatel
 y a 15–20-minute walk from Yonge and Lawrence subway station.\n• Alter
 natively\, take a bus or Uber from the station.\n\n**Come ready to laugh\,
  blush a little and have a fabulous time!**
