SUMMARY:Name That Tune (The Very Best of 7 Decades) (November 28th)  
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Come join us for a fun day of **Name That Tune** as we travel through seve
 n decades of unforgettable songs!\n\nFrom old favourites and classic hits 
 to songs you may not have heard in years\, we’ll put our musical memorie
 s to the test while enjoying a relaxed day of laughs\, drinks\, food and g
 ood company.\n\n\\*Please note that we are at The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub a
